#: ../../tools/nci_thesaurus_tools.rst:32 aad0a9911bd442f089d64a7d8a934d0d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the direct child concepts of an NCI Thesaurus "
"concept code. Returns the immediate subcategories/subtypes of a concept "
"in the NCI ontology hierarchy. Useful for navigating the cancer "
"terminology hierarchy and finding more specific terms. Example: C3262 "
"(Neoplasm) has children C4741 (Neoplasm by Morphology), C3263 (Neoplasm "
"by Site), C7062 (Neoplasm by Special Category)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nci_thesaurus_tools.rst:34
#: ../../tools/nci_thesaurus_tools.rst:65
